warning[process-state]: assignment to `ENV["JULIA_DEBUG"]` changes environment of whole process
 --> positive.jl:2:1
  |
2 | ENV["JULIA_DEBUG"] = "Corset"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ process-wide environment
  |
  = why: other threads read and write environment at same time; Base docs call it thread-unsafe
  = fix: pass variables to subprocess with `addenv(cmd, key => value)`; pass other settings as arguments   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain process-state
  = note: warn from composability group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow process-state -- <reason>`

