warning[process-state]: `cd` changes working directory of whole process
  --> positive.jl:19:1
   |
19 | cd("build")
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^ process-wide working directory
   |
   = why: relative paths in other tasks resolve against changed directory
   = fix: pass directory to subprocess with `Cmd(cmd; dir = path)`; build paths with `joinpath`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain process-state

